B.Ow=new A.fH("Capitalization rate","A property income measure, typically net operating income divided by the property value or purchase price.","Valuation")
B.Oz=new A.fH("Comparative method","A valuation approach that compares a property with relevant evidence from similar properties, adjusted for differences.","Valuation")
B.Ot=new A.fH("Depreciation","A reduction in the value of an asset over time due to age, use, condition, or obsolescence.","Valuation")
B.Ou=new A.fH("Easement","A right to use another person\u2019s land for a specific purpose, such as access or utilities.","Property law")
B.Oq=new A.fH("Freehold estate","An ownership interest in land held for an indefinite duration, subject to applicable law and rights.","Property law")
B.Oy=new A.fH("Lease","A contract granting a tenant the right to occupy or use property for an agreed period and on stated terms.","Property management")
B.Ox=new A.fH("Net operating income","Property operating income remaining after operating expenses, before financing costs and income tax.","Investment")
B.Or=new A.fH("Reversionary interest","The right to regain possession of property when a temporary interest, such as a lease, ends.","Property law")
B.Os=new A.fH("Sinking fund","A fund accumulated over time to meet future replacement or major repair costs.","Property management")
B.Ov=new A.fH("Yield","The income return on an investment expressed as a proportion of its value or cost.","Investment")
B.uB=s([B.Ow,B.Oz,B.Ot,B.Ou,B.Oq,B.Oy,B.Ox,B.Or,B.Os,B.Ov],A.aG("G<fH>"))
